      narr:theme "Superseding Zypherion with Meridian for analytics due to streaming ingestion gaps" ;
      skos:note "A revised database decision replaces the earlier Zypherion adoption. Critical streaming ingestion gaps in Zypherion triggered the switch to Meridian, which natively supports both batch and streaming. The Q3 2026 migration window is unchanged." ;
      dct:source narr:Sample_MeridianDecision_20260406 .

    # Claim: Zypherion streaming gap (new — explicit contradiction of prior adoption rationale)
    narr:Claim_ZypherionStreamingGap a narr:Claim ;
